# Files Cloudflare should not serve as part of the website. Same format as .gitignore.
# They stay in the GitHub repository; this only keeps them off the deployed site.

# Repository housekeeping
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore

# Documentation and licence text (read these on GitHub)
README.md
DOCS.md
LICENSE

# Local preview helper
preview-floor3d.bat

# Logo files and the README picture (used by the GitHub page, not by the site)
# The leading slash matters: it means "only at the top level", so floor3d/assets/ (the photo the
# opening sequence needs) is still served.
/assets/
/screenshots/
